  message: "FIXTURE LANDED (WI-romuh). Import from recorded_rust_analyzer_1_94_0: aardvark_dns_index_bytes(), aardvark_dns_crate_root(), AARDVARK_DNS_PAIRING. The SCIP arm's Symbols come from translate_scip_to_hg(aardvark_dns_index_bytes(), reader-over-crate); the tree-sitter arm runs live on aardvark_dns_crate_root(). ACCEPTANCE NUMBER CORRECTED: under the declared anchors the committed input pairs **148 of 169** (not 138), 0 ambiguous — test_recorded_fixtures.py::test_pairing_under_the_declared_rule is the reference computation (same path, equal name keys, token line inside item span). The 21 unpaired: 18 namespaces + 2 `type` aliases + 1 `static` (rust.py emits none). When the pass has a function name, add it to CROSS_BACKEND_CONSUMERS in check_recorded_producer_input.py so a test cannot feed it rust.py-derived input."  # b195
